  "exit_and_retry_contracts": {
    "windows_configure": "Configure records its original native exit despite a PowerShell Tee pipeline; continue-on-error is paired with a required Report CMake failure step exiting1. Later steps require configure success. A configure failure cannot qualify the job.",
