    "windows_validators": "Native exit code must be0 and log must contain an exact SUCCESS line. No runtime retry wrapper. Fixed-seed lane is independent and still runs after the randomized lane fails, unless cancelled; it never rescues that failure.",
    "macos_validators": "set -euo pipefail preserves validator failure through tee; each log requires an exact SUCCESS line. No runtime validator retries. Each architecture has4 separate required lanes. Download retries are not validator runtime retries.",
    "linux_validators": "Wrapper preserves command and tee outcomes and requires exit0 plus exact SUCCESS and no FAILED. Only139 with a started and last-completed test phase and no SUCCESS/FAILED is eligible for a fresh full retry, maximum3attempts. Failed attempts must be preserved. This is eligibility, not proof of crash ownership or suite completion. Seeded replay is an independent required lane.",
    "linux_diagnostics": "Failure-only gdb/fault-thread replays are diagnostic and cannot replace the original required validation outcomes. Exit-propagation fixture and fault-thread shim selftests are additional required successful job steps.",
